{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-box-braid-irreducibility","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:box-braid-irreducibility","kind":"proposition","title":"The $\\gamma\\gamma \\to \\nu\\nu^{\\sigma}$ box braid is irreducible","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-virtual-particles-exceptional-divisor","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-electron-immortality","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-photon-wavefront"],"tags":["neutrino","stability","box-diagram","groebner-basis","irreducibility","skein-relation","weak-force","photon","virtual-particles"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Archimedean.BoxBraidIrreducibility","text":"box-braid-irreducibility.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:box-braid-irreducibility\"></a><p>The process <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\gamma\\gamma \\to \\nu\\nu^{\\sigma}</code> requires the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{3,5}</code> torus knot topology. The crossing number <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c(T_{3,5}) = 10</code> is a topological invariant. Therefore:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>The process cannot occur before Planck step <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">10</code>.</li>\n<li>No simpler mediator exists.</li>\n<li>The box is the minimum-crossing topology for any <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\gamma</code>–<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nu</code> interaction.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>The <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{3,5}</code> braid word.</strong>\nThe torus knot <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{3,5}</code> has braid representation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\sigma_0\\sigma_1)^5 \\in B_3</code> with 10 crossings.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.md","leanStatus":"proved","heading":"Proposition","number":"11.1.8"}
